
.TH M_param2 3 "" "Odoc" "OCaml Library"
.SH Name
Oxcaml\.M_param2
.SH Synopsis
.sp 
.in 2
\fBModule Oxcaml\.M_param2\fR
.in 
.sp 
.fi 
Each instantiation renders its own copy of param_kind, so both uses should link to the copy on their own page rather than to S_param's\.
.nf 
.SH Documentation
.sp 
.nf 
\f[CB]kind_\fR param_kind = value \f[CB]mod\fR portable
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR ('a : param_kind) t
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
A kind-constrained type parameter inside a signature expansion\.
.nf 
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR t_direct : param_kind
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
A kind annotation inside a signature expansion\.
.nf 

